# Loupe's own data: the live database, API keys, the admin passphrase hash, sessions, captures, caches and the keeper session never go in.
# What travels with the repo so a clone opens with the sample library: the sample images, the admin's uploads, the flag evidence and the seed
# (data/seed/loupe-seed.db, written by `python loupe.py seed export`: misses, moments and flags with every secret stripped).
data/*
!data/samples/
!data/uploads/
!data/flags/
!data/seed/

__pycache__/
*.pyc
node_modules/
.env
*.bak
*.bak-*
